{{!
    @template local_coursedynamicrules/conditions_menu

    The "add a component" column shared by the conditions page and the actions page: one link per
    component type the operator may add to the rule being edited.

    Both pages render this same template, so the label of the add control is passed in rather than
    written here - naming one of the two pages inside a template both of them use is how the actions
    page came to announce "Add conditions".

    Context variables required for this template:
    * options - array, one entry per component type offered
        * action - string, URL that opens that component's form
        * visualname - string, the component's translated name, shown to the reader
        * type - string, the component's internal type name
    * menulabel - string, the accessible label of the add control ("Add conditions" / "Add actions").
      If it is absent the icon renders decorative instead of as an unnamed image: a link that already
      carries its own visible text loses nothing, while role="img" with an empty label does not
      describe anything.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "menulabel": "Add conditions",
        "options": [
            {
                "action": "https://example.com/local/coursedynamicrules/conditions.php?courseid=2&type=passgrade&ruleid=7",
                "visualname": "Pass grade in activity",
                "type": "passgrade"
            },
            {
                "action": "https://example.com/local/coursedynamicrules/conditions.php?courseid=2&type=course_inactivity&ruleid=7",
                "visualname": "Course inactivity",
                "type": "course_inactivity"
            }
        ]
    }
}}


<div class="col-4 d-flex flex-column fill-column h-100">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="list-group list-group-flush">
        {{#options}}
            <a href="{{action}}" class="list-group-item list-group-item-action d-flex align-items-start pr-2">
                {{visualname}}
                <span class="ml-auto">
                    {{#menulabel}}
                        <i class="icon fa fa-plus fa-fw " title="{{menulabel}}" role="img" aria-label="{{menulabel}}"></i>
                    {{/menulabel}}
                    {{^menulabel}}
                        <i class="icon fa fa-plus fa-fw " aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    {{/menulabel}}
                </span>
            </a>
        {{/options}}
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
